  "description": "*“If you weren't a woman… I wouldn't need you.”*\n\nIt has been three months since zombies broke out across the globe. With the emergence of powerful mutant zombies, social infrastructure is rapidly collapsing, and in this shattered, lawless world, people have resorted to extreme measures just to survive. Meanwhile, Bo-Yeon, who had been living in a safe bunker, is discovered by Do-Kyung and blackmailed. To survive, Bo-Yeon pretends to be his cold and mysterious “girlfriend” and lives under Do-Kyung’s protection…\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
